		{ String _name = "NMTMarketDockTip";				String _text = "NMT Docks Market: a work location where citizens can acquire the goods they need. Vendors obtain goods from the entire map to keep the market stocked. Size: 10x10. Cost: 52 lumber, 76 logs. Happiness radius (goods): 45. Capacity: 12,000 weight. Employs 1-8 vendors. Tips: stocks food, clothes, fuel, tools and health items."; }

